text She holds up a nearby book and opens it on her lap.
text She flips through the pages to find where she last left off.
text Her hands stop and she begins reading.
text She's serious about this.
text Because the sentences go left to right, I can see her eyes moving in the same direction. It's funny.
text I get the feeling that her reading speed is abnormally fast.
text Oh, she's turning a page.
text Wow, she's on the second page already.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait, am I really just going to sit here and watch?
