text The light reflecting off the curtains is blinding.
text They're probably playing a ball game in gym class. I hear cheers from time to time.
text And to my side is the sound of turning pages...
text What a peaceful day.
text The mid-April weather is gentle.
text Besides the book-loving girl and me, there's no one else in the library.
text There's only one thing to do.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm napping.
text I put my head down on the desk and slowly close my eyes...
